{"id":"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md","title":"Singular Chains and Cochains with Ring Coefficients","display":"df-singular-coefficient-data — Singular Chains and Cochains with Ring Coefficients","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-singular-coefficient-data","aliases":["58-df-singular-coefficient-data"],"display":"df-singular-coefficient-data — Singular Chains and Cochains with Ring Coefficients","depends_on":["[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-singular-coefficient-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-singular-coefficient-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-singular-coefficient-data — Singular Chains and Cochains with Ring Coefficients"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" href=\"?note=fb6796e83e0c5ef4\" title=\"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md\">58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span>。本文件所有带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的构造仅在此域上定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(n,a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n(X,\\tau)\">\\(S_n(X,\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{r,i}\">\\(\\delta_{r,i}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S\\)</span> 使用奇异链依赖中的实际函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^A\">\\(R^A\\)</span> 上的加法、减法和标量乘法逐点使用给定环运算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_A=\\{\\langle t,0_R\\rangle:t\\in A\\}\">\\(0_A=\\{\\langle t,0_R\\rangle:t\\in A\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(v)=\\{t\\in\\operatorname{dom}v:v(t)\\ne0_R\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(v)=\\{t\\in\\operatorname{dom}v:v(t)\\ne0_R\\}\\)</span>。整数系数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m r\">\\(m r\\)</span> 表示加法群中的整数倍；有限和与空和据此取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}\">\\([c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}\">\\([u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}\\)</span> 的表达式分别仅对下式中的闭链、上闭链使用。链与上链均为函数图，次数由下标给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle Y,\\upsilon,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle Y,\\upsilon,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>，则两空间使用同一环结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> 的连续性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\)</span> 表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_{\\sigma,n}\">\\(\\partial_{\\sigma,n}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n(\\sigma)\">\\(C_n(\\sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\sigma,n}\">\\(d_{\\sigma,n}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^n(\\sigma)\">\\(C^n(\\sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}\">\\(f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n(\\sigma)\">\\(C_n(\\sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}\">\\(f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^n(\\rho)\">\\(C^n(\\rho)\\)</span>。各逐点公式唯一确定相应函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}=1\\leftrightarrow P\">\\(\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}=1\\leftrightarrow P\\)</span>；式中的乘法按整数倍作用于环元素。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|&lt;\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|&lt;\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n&gt;0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)},&amp;n\\le0,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_{\\sigma,n}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)},&amp;n&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n&gt;0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)},&amp;n\\le0,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_{\\sigma,n}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;n\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)},&amp;n&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nZ_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c\\in C_n(\\sigma):\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)=0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&amp;\nB_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\partial_{\\sigma,n+1}(b):b\\in C_{n+1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nZ^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\in C^n(\\sigma):d_{\\sigma,n}(u)=0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&amp;\nB^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d_{\\sigma,n-1}(v):v\\in C^{n-1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c+b:b\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\},&amp;\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u+v:v\\in B^n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nH_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},&amp;\nH^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}:u\\in Z^n(\\sigma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nZ_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c\\in C_n(\\sigma):\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)=0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&amp;\nB_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\partial_{\\sigma,n+1}(b):b\\in C_{n+1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nZ^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u\\in C^n(\\sigma):d_{\\sigma,n}(u)=0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&amp;\nB^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{d_{\\sigma,n-1}(v):v\\in C^{n-1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{c+b:b\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\},&amp;\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{u+v:v\\in B^n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nH_n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},&amp;\nH^n(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}:u\\in Z^n(\\sigma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}+[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[u+v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},&amp;\nr[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[ru]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}+[b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[c+b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},&amp;\nr[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[rc]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}+[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[u+v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},&amp;\nr[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[ru]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}+[b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[c+b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},&amp;\nr[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&amp;\\coloneqq[rc]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\to\nu\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,u(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\}))\\cdot_R\nv(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\}))\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;a,b\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)},&amp;a&lt;0\\lor b&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\to\nu\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,u(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\}))\\cdot_R\nv(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\}))\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\},&amp;a,b\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)},&amp;a&lt;0\\lor b&lt;0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in Z^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in Z^b(\\sigma)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a}\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,b}\n\\coloneqq[u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a+b}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in Z^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in Z^b(\\sigma)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a}\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,b}\n\\coloneqq[u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a+b}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\to\\bigl(\nf^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\},\\\\\nf^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nf_{*,\\sigma,\\rho,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},[f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\rho,n}\\rangle:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nf^*_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\rho,n},[f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}\\rangle:u\\in Z^n(\\rho)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\to\\bigl(\nf^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\},\\\\\nf^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nf_{*,\\sigma,\\rho,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},[f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\rho,n}\\rangle:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nf^*_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\rho,n},[f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}\\rangle:u\\in Z^n(\\rho)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall c\\in C_n(\\sigma)\\;&amp;\\partial_{\\sigma,n-1}(\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c))=0_{S_{n-2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^n(\\sigma)\\;&amp;d_{\\sigma,n+1}(d_{\\sigma,n}(u))=0_{S_{n+2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\;\\forall v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\;&amp;\nd_{\\sigma,a+b}(u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v)\n=d_{\\sigma,a}(u)\\smile_{\\sigma,a+1,b}v+(-1)^a u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b+1}d_{\\sigma,b}(v).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall c\\in C_n(\\sigma)\\;&amp;\\partial_{\\sigma,n-1}(\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c))=0_{S_{n-2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^n(\\sigma)\\;&amp;d_{\\sigma,n+1}(d_{\\sigma,n}(u))=0_{S_{n+2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\;\\forall v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\;&amp;\nd_{\\sigma,a+b}(u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v)\n=d_{\\sigma,a}(u)\\smile_{\\sigma,a+1,b}v+(-1)^a u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b+1}d_{\\sigma,b}(v).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是原整数奇异链定义的系数扩展；没有改动原整数函数名或其函数图。取整数环时，各公式与该依赖逐项一致。</li>\n<li>负次数采用零模，故零次输入导致定义系统中的负次数时仍有确定的取值。没有为回避这一情形额外要求输入次数为正。</li>\n<li>上同调类、同调类及诱导映射均由实际代表元和边界陪集构成。系数环的底集与运算完整保存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，不从底集猜测环结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"fb6796e83e0c5ef4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma=\\langle X,\\tau,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"n,a,b\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"S_n(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{r,i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R^A","display":false},{"tex":"0_A=\\{\\langle t,0_R\\rangle:t\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(v)=\\{t\\in\\operatorname{dom}v:v(t)\\ne0_R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m r","display":false},{"tex":"[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}","display":false},{"tex":"[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\langle Y,\\upsilon,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_{\\sigma,n}","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\sigma,n}","display":false},{"tex":"C^n(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}","display":false},{"tex":"C^n(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{\\{P\\}}=1\\leftrightarrow P","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\{c\\in R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}:|\\operatorname{supp}(c)|<\\omega\\},\n\\qquad C^n(\\sigma)\\coloneqq R^{S_n(X,\\tau)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,\\sum_{q\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}\\sum_{i\\in n+1}(-1)^i c(q)\\mathbf1_{\\{s=q\\circ\\delta_{n,i}\\}}\\rangle:s\\in S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)\\},&n>0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)},&n\\le0,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nd_{\\sigma,n}(u)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{i\\in n+2}(-1)^i u(q\\circ\\delta_{n+1,i})\\rangle:q\\in S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)\\},&n\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)},&n<0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nZ_n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{c\\in C_n(\\sigma):\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c)=0_{S_{n-1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&\nB_n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{\\partial_{\\sigma,n+1}(b):b\\in C_{n+1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nZ^n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{u\\in C^n(\\sigma):d_{\\sigma,n}(u)=0_{S_{n+1}(X,\\tau)}\\},&\nB^n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{d_{\\sigma,n-1}(v):v\\in C^{n-1}(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq\\{c+b:b\\in B_n(\\sigma)\\},&\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq\\{u+v:v\\in B^n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nH_n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},&\nH^n(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\{[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}:u\\in Z^n(\\sigma)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}+[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq[u+v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},&\nr[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq[ru]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n},\\\\\n[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}+[b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq[c+b]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},&\nr[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}&\\coloneqq[rc]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n}\\quad(r\\in R).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\to\nu\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle s,u(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle i,i\\rangle:i\\in a+1\\}))\\cdot_R\nv(s\\circ\\mathrm{AffineFace}_S(a+b,\\{\\langle j,a+j\\rangle:j\\in b+1\\}))\\rangle:s\\in S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)\\},&a,b\\ge0,\\\\\n0_{S_{a+b}(X,\\tau)},&a<0\\lor b<0.\n\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu\\in Z^a(\\sigma)\\land v\\in Z^b(\\sigma)\\to\n[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a}\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}[v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,b}\n\\coloneqq[u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,a+b}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,X,\\tau,Y,\\upsilon)\\to\\bigl(\nf^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(s)\\mathbf1_{\\{q=f\\circ s\\}}\\rangle:q\\in S_n(Y,\\upsilon)\\},\\\\\nf^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,u(f\\circ s)\\rangle:s\\in S_n(X,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nf_{*,\\sigma,\\rho,n}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[c]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\sigma,n},[f^{\\#}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(c)]^{\\mathrm h}_{\\rho,n}\\rangle:c\\in Z_n(\\sigma)\\},\\\\\nf^*_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle[u]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\rho,n},[f^{\\flat}_{\\sigma,\\rho,n}(u)]^{\\mathrm c}_{\\sigma,n}\\rangle:u\\in Z^n(\\rho)\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall c\\in C_n(\\sigma)\\;&\\partial_{\\sigma,n-1}(\\partial_{\\sigma,n}(c))=0_{S_{n-2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^n(\\sigma)\\;&d_{\\sigma,n+1}(d_{\\sigma,n}(u))=0_{S_{n+2}(X,\\tau)},\\\\\n\\forall u\\in C^a(\\sigma)\\;\\forall v\\in C^b(\\sigma)\\;&\nd_{\\sigma,a+b}(u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b}v)\n=d_{\\sigma,a}(u)\\smile_{\\sigma,a+1,b}v+(-1)^a u\\smile_{\\sigma,a,b+1}d_{\\sigma,b}(v).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false}